<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\診察室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Um... this kind of thing... 
{PAUSE ""}
isn't uncommon."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The doctor delivered the verdict in a calm voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I was sitting down, my knees shook uncontrollably.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That can't be true...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Please! One more time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Please check one more time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, but... we've run every test there is... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm afraid it's 100% certain..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sat on the chair, utterly <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ぼうぜん">stunned</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My happiness began to come crashing down.<PG>
"Um... given the situation, it would be best to have surgery as soon as possible. 
{PAUSE ""}
If it's left as is, it could affect the mother's health as well..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No! Absolutely not! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Mine... mine and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s baby...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I clutched my belly and sank to the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And also... I think it's best to tell you this sooner rather than later... 
{PAUSE ""}
I know this is a cruel thing to say at a time like this..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\診察室赤.gal" "NORMAL" "25" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―What I was told next, like a follow-up blow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That I would never again 
{PAUSE ""}
be able to get pregnant...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The new family member that <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> had been so happy about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The dream we had talked about, of making our children friends with <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All of it had turned into an illusion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart was plunged into the abyss.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Some days later, I had the new family member who had died taken out of my belly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村家新居.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After I left the hospital, I knelt before <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> with my knees and forehead on the floor and apologized at the top of my voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... there's no reason for you to apologize... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It's a shame about the baby, but I'm glad you're safe, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">As long as you're safe, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that's all I need..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> offered me every word of encouragement he could.<PG>
However,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">How can you say something so carefree!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　It's fine because I'm safe!? You were so happy with me when we found out we were having a child! Was that a lie!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That's... that's just...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア早い開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I ran into the bedroom alone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村家寝室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No... I don't want this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I clutched my head and lay face down on the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What an awful woman I am.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> must not have known how to deal with me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet I had said such terrible things.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> would probably be fed up with me too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> would probably find it hard to see me, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Family... the family I had always dreamed of...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's all... over now...<PG>
―For a while I stayed burrowed in the bed alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remembered <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> once telling me I was extreme.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking it was all over had probably been a bit extreme after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE>'s words calmed my heart just a little.<PG>
Next, I thought about how I could face <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> isn't to blame for anything. Any way I look at it, I'm the one at fault.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I heard <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>'s voice through the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm coming in, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I stayed under the covers without moving, but the door opened without waiting for my answer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It seemed only <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> had come into the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had heard <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> was suffering from terrible <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つわり">morning sickness</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have really mustered all her strength to come.<PG>
I had told her by phone on the very day we found out the baby had died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the time, <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> had just listened to me and hadn't said much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she had come despite <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つわり">morning sickness</STYLE> that bad, did she have something to tell me in person?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> gently <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="な">stroked</STYLE> my back through the covers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was still burrowed in the bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm sorry. I wanted our kids to be friends..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What are you talking about... Right now, what matters is you getting back on your feet, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"They said... I can't have babies anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... I heard that too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And so... um... </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">about that, there's something I want to suggest..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing that much, I poked my head out from under the covers.
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I talked it over with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too, and... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">my child, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">won't you adopt them?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I slowly sat up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... don't say weird things... Something like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The way I'm doing now, I can have a second one too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you'd raise them properly, wouldn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a fact that if I were to have a child, I would have no choice but to use a surrogate mother or adopt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I can't answer something like that out of nowhere..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see... then think it over. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> has to weigh in on this too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
To be honest, if adopting meant I could have a child, I want to welcome them as family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if it were <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE>'s child, I'm confident I would raise them with all my heart and love.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> had been so happy about having a child, and yet she had made this offer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not only <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> but <STYLE ID="7">Ryoji-san</STYLE> too must have felt terribly <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ふびん">sorry</STYLE> for me.<PG>
But... even so... 
{PAUSE ""}
stealing <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE>'s happiness away from her...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way that could make me happy...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Having calmed down somewhat, I left the bedroom with <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村家新居.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In the living room were not only <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> but <STYLE ID="7">Ryoji-san</STYLE> as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the look of the two of them, they seemed to have been having the same talk as us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, we'll head home. There's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s health to think of."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Got it. I'll talk it over with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and decide."</STYLE><PG>
I couldn't read from <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>'s expression what he was thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if he was going to talk it over with me and decide, it seemed he wasn't ruling it out completely, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"See you. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, we're going home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Only <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> and I were left in the room.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "225" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'm sorry. For taking it out on you earlier..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, it's okay. Anybody gets like that sometimes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> spoke kind words to me, as always.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE> both, I really am blessed with the people around me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you think, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">? You heard from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uugh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't give an answer right away after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, what that really meant was that I was torn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I realized I was harboring hopes along the lines of, if everyone would allow it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, you must be tired. Want to rest a bit? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Or how about we go for a drive, to take your mind off things?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> was trying every way he could to look after my feelings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I couldn't answer that suggestion right away either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on, let's go! Today, you're keeping me company!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> was unusually forceful for him, pulling me by the hand and out the door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
The air outside was cold. It seemed winter would soon be setting in for real.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We got into the car.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車室内エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\美冬車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There was no conversation between us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
