{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you think it's wrong to lean on her this much, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> always tells me that if I'm ever in trouble, she'll help me with anything. </STYLE>
